    "done_when": "Context: item (1) of followup f-ctta-sweep-durability-and-placement. The sweep-cost node (run r-20261002T202550601832-ctta-sweep-cost-on-carrier-size) compared base and head receipts on 18 fixtures with a script under /tmp that was never committed, and its log prints only nodes, edges and overflow. Deliverable: a --compare BASE HEAD mode in benchmarks/contour_tree_brute_force.py that loads two receipt files written by that benchmark and compares every receipt field: node vertices, node values, node masks, critical types, compact edges, edge masks and the overflow flag. It prints one line per field with its mismatch count and exits nonzero on any mismatch. A new tests/test_contour_tree_receipt_comparator.py asserts that identical receipts pass and that a receipt differing in exactly one field fails naming that field, once for each field. Gate, logged under the run directory: the new test passes and fails under the negative control; tests/test_contour_tree_brute_force.py, run with JAX_PLATFORMS=cpu in a fresh process in place on this fleet allocation, adds no failure against the dispatch base. Every uv command carries --no-sync and nothing runs uv sync. The manifest's status is one of complete, blocked or failed.",
